# The workshop, not the game. The art pipeline — the prompts and the ComfyUI
# runner, the roll loop, the cut-out chain, the sprite viewer, the brief and
# the recipe — and every generated take live on the machine that draws the
# sprites, and only there. The repository ships the sprites in `assets/art/`
# and the atlas that says where each frame is: somebody who clones this
# wants the game, not seventy megabytes of takes behind it.
